A cloned heading drops its ids

```
# *A*{#z}

</#A>
.
<section id="A">
  <h1><strong id="z">A</strong></h1>
  <p><a href="#A"><strong>A</strong></a></p>
</section>
```

```
# *[b]{#y abbr="T"}*{#z}

</#b>
.
<section id="b">
  <h1><strong id="z"><abbr title="T" id="y">b</abbr></strong></h1>
  <p><a href="#b"><strong><abbr title="T">b</abbr></strong></a></p>
</section>
```
